  "description": {
    "raw": "The target’s skin secretes a small amount of venom-resistant oils for the spell’s duration. The target cannot accidentally poison itself while applying poison. Additionally, the target does not risk exposure to a creature’s poison when attempting to milk venom (Ultimate Wilderness 142).",
